BridgeDock browser-login adaptation (2026-11-03)
----------------------------------------------
The bundled library includes the local CursorWebLogin.patch, based on
cursor-agent2api v0.2.2, commit 75a9770b06f6eeba3f1cdd8da12a7a9fa5c8987d.
It adds Grok Bot proof-key browser login, polling, credential persistence,
Cursor refresh-token renewal and selected-team request headers.
Rebuild with Vendor/build-cursor-web-login.sh.

Protocol references:
https://github.com/qunqin24/Pulse/blob/main/Sources/Pulse/Auth/CursorWebLogin.swift
https://github.com/andreanjos/grokbot-headless/blob/main/grok-bot-headless.mjs
The flow and renewal endpoint were also checked against the installed
Grok Bot 0.78.1 application. The adaptation does not embed personal credentials.
